From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hyunjin Song <tteu.ingog@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 May 2022 09:57:09 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Fix Carla version detction in CarlaBase (#6403)

carla.h tested CARLA_VERSION_HEX before including anything that defines
it, so it never took CarlaNativePlugin.h and declared Carla's functions
with CARLA_EXPORT, which Carla 2.1 renamed.

Upstream: backport of 3518d307f47c79db06bd0e9430f39b91488673dc, on master
after 1.2.2
---
 plugins/carlabase/carla.h | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/plugins/carlabase/carla.h b/plugins/carlabase/carla.h
index fb54e22..6f1971e 100644
--- a/plugins/carlabase/carla.h
+++ b/plugins/carlabase/carla.h
@@ -28,6 +28,7 @@
 #include <QtCore/QMutex>
 
 #define REAL_BUILD // FIXME this shouldn't be needed
+#include "CarlaDefines.h"
 #if CARLA_VERSION_HEX >= 0x010911
     #include "CarlaNativePlugin.h"
 #else
